# Build output — regenerated by `quarto render`, never committed.
_site/
.quarto/
/.luarc.json
*_files/

# NOTE: _freeze/ is deliberately NOT ignored. It is the committed execution
# cache that keeps published posts reproducible. See CLAUDE.md § Freeze rule.

# R
.Rproj.user/
.Rhistory
.RData
.Rproj.user

# Python
__pycache__/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Local-only, deliberately untracked. This repo is PUBLIC.
# ENVIRONMENTS.md maps this machine — software inventory and versions, MCP
# server wiring, where API keys are kept, open unfixed issues. Useful to agents
# working here, a reconnaissance document to anyone else. Keep it on disk; keep
# it out of git.
ENVIRONMENTS.md
New Text Document.txt

# OS / editor cruft
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# Quarto's jupyter-engine intermediates. The trailing * matters: an interrupted
# render leaves index.quarto_ipynb_1, _2, … and `*.quarto_ipynb` misses those.
**/*.quarto_ipynb*
